{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hide_rolled","model_identifier":"hide_rolled","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## hide_rolled\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -8.0..8.0, y -4.5..3.2, z -7.5..-0.8 (size 16.0 x 7.8 x 6.8 u = 45 x 22 x 19 cm).\nRolled hide: a furry raw hide rolled into a bundle (~45 cm), the pale skin side showing in the spiral ends, tied with two cords, a flap and leg end hanging loose. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 4.5.\n"},"description":"## hide_rolled\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -8.0..8.0, y -4.5..3.2, z -7.5..-0.8 (size 16.0 x 7.8 x 6.8 u = 45 x 22 x 19 cm).\nRolled hide: a furry raw hide rolled into a bundle (~45 cm), the pale skin side showing in the spiral ends, tied with two cords, a flap and leg end hanging loose. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 4.5.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"roll","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,-3.0,-7.0],"to":[8.0,3.0,-1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,0,52.0,6.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,13,18.0,19.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,7,16.0,13.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,13,24.0,19.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16,7,32.0,13.0],"texture":